LeLampEmpathy — Third-Party Attributions
=========================================

This project vendors hardware description assets from the upstream LeLamp
project:

  - assets/lelamp_5dof.urdf, assets/lelamp_5dof.xml
    Source: https://github.com/humancomputerlab/LeLamp (GPL-3.0)
    3D-print / CAD sources: LeLamp repo /3D/ folder and OnShape project.

Expressive-motion design vocabulary (kinesics / proxemics primitives) is
adapted from:

  - "ELEGNT: Expressive and Functional Movement Design for
    Non-Anthropomorphic Robot" (arXiv:2501.12493).
    Note: the ELEGNT authors have not released code or data; primitives
    here are independent parametric implementations informed by the
    paper's published motion vocabulary.

Both upstream works remain under their original licenses. This project as a
whole is released under GPL-3.0 (see LICENSE).
